This product's container image redistributes an unmodified, statically linked
FFmpeg binary. Kiln itself does not link against FFmpeg; it invokes the binary
as a separate process.

  FFmpeg 8.1.2
  https://ffmpeg.org
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later (GPLv3+),
  as the binary is built with --enable-gpl --enable-version3.

  The binary is copied verbatim from the upstream multi-arch image pinned in
  deploy/docker/Dockerfile:

    mwader/static-ffmpeg:8.1.2
    sha256:33f770f812cbfc3de96c547157fc9faf8bd95a36481753439ffa761045167585

  The exact build configuration is embedded in the binary and can be printed
  with `ffmpeg -buildconf`. Corresponding source for this version of FFmpeg is
  available from https://ffmpeg.org/download.html and from the upstream image's
  build definition.

