--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The administration console resolves Chinese channel names to Mandarin pinyin and
Cantonese jyutping for search. The reading tables in
modules/httpserver/admin/assets/data/romanize.js are generated from the Unicode
Character Database by scripts/gen-romanize-data.go, which reads the kMandarin,
kXHC1983, kTGHZ2013, kCantonese, and kSimplifiedVariant fields and re-encodes
them. No Unicode source file is redistributed verbatim.

